{"id":"wb-7-1386","name":"大观楼","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"大观楼 (昆明)","text":"大观楼是位于中华人民共和国云南省昆明市的一座楼阁，坐落于市区西南部，南邻滇池，围绕其建设有大观公园。1983年，核心景区大观楼被列为省级重点文物保护单位，2013年又被国务院公布为国家级重点文物保护单位。2006年，大观公园整体列入国家4A级旅游景区，是滇池风景名胜区的重要组成部分。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A4%A7%E8%A7%82%E6%A5%BC_(%E6%98%86%E6%98%8E)","revisionId":93553591,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93553591","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/d85b522292f990baf78226b5.jpg","title":"大观楼_2025-09-20_13.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%A4%A7%E8%A7%82%E6%A5%BC_2025-09-20_13.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/bd/%E5%A4%A7%E8%A7%82%E6%A5%BC_2025-09-20_13.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Kcx36","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​昆明大观楼","width":320,"height":213}}